[fault] executing a divide by zero (expect a fault dump)

=== HARD FAULT ===
  PC=0x0000f83c LR=0x0000f573 xPSR=0x41000000 (PSP)
  R0=0x0 R1=0x0 R2=0xffff0000 R3=0x0 R12=0x20000ef0
  DIVBYZERO: the UDF of __aeabi_idiv0/__aeabi_ldiv0
